{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29999","headline":"和段学士对雪 · 喻凫","name":"和段学士对雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"盈尺知丰稔，开窗对酒壶。\n飘当大野匝，洒到急流无。\n密际西风尽，凝间朔气扶。\n乾摧鸟栖枿，冷射夜残罏。\n赞月澄斜汉，兼沙搅北湖。\n慙於郢客坐，一此调巴歈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"喻凫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29999.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29999","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}